 "description": "One owner-operated Rebecca Belle Boutique acceptance order for a dedicated 1.00 USDC test product on Base mainnet. No catalog items. Creates a bounded order, observes the existing managed escrow, records test shipment and delivery, and independently checks native USDC receipts. This tool never signs, submits or initiates transfers and rejects payment headers. quote is public; other actions require a request-bound X-Wever-Wallet-Proof for /api/boutique-real-money-acceptance and configured buyer/operator. The human executes separately approved funding and release through the unchanged wever_agent-escrow-lite tool. That rail has separate 0.10 USDC API fees after its free allowance and automatic expiry refunds. Test evidence is not customer revenue or actual merchandise fulfillment.",
